**AST 노드 구조**:
```
Expression
├── Literal (Int, Float, String, Boolean, Nothing)
├── Identifier
├── BinaryOp (op, left, right)
├── UnaryOp (op, operand)
├── Call (func, args)
├── IndexAccess, MemberAccess, TypeAnnotation
├── ArrayLiteral, TupleLiteral
└── ...

Statement
├── Assignment (target, value)
├── FunctionDef (name, params, body)
├── IfStmt (condition, then, else)
├── WhileStmt, ForStmt
├── ReturnStmt
└── Block
```

